<!-- 2 TODAY -->
<section class="slide"><div class="eyebrow">TODAY AND TOMORROW</div><h2>TODAY AND TOMORROW</h2><div class="grid2" style="margin-top:18px"><div class="card"><b>Today:</b><p>A regulatory or market signal emerges. It remains in a report. Sales does not connect it to a specific account. The customer defines the requirement independently. We wait for RFP – and then we react. <i>The company competes primarily on price and delivery capability.</i></p><p><b>Proposed future:</b></p><p>The same signal is connected to customer exposure, market pressures, emerging demands, operational vulnerability, available capabilities, and relevant reference cases. Sales receives an evidence-backed ‘Buying Insight & Hypothesis’ and ‘Proactive Proposal’ to be used before the customer has specified the requirement.</p></div><div class="card dark" style="border:7px solid #000"><div class="mint" style="font-size:19px">Shaping demand means:</div><h3 class="mint" style="font-family:Sora;line-height:1.35">helping customers recognize and act on an emerging, evidence-supported need before it becomes a formal procurement requirement.</h3><div class="mint" style="font-size:18px;margin-top:12px">It does not mean manufacturing artificial demand.</div></div></div><div class="footer"><span>vivicta*</span><span>02</span></div></section>

<!-- 3 HYPOTHESIS -->
<section class="slide"><div class="eyebrow">THE HYPOTHESIS</div><h2>THE HYPOTHESIS OF ‘SHAPING DEMAND’</h2><p class="sub">Building the Foresight-Driven Agentic Sales Motion with Quantifiable Business Outcomes</p><div class="card" style="border-left:10px solid #8AA0A0;margin-top:12px"><b>Hypothesis: “Operate UPSTREAM - before demand becomes an RFP we have to react to. Siloed speed and efficiency create local efficiency. Upstream operation creates market shaping advantage”.</b></div><div class="timeline"><div class="trow"><span style="color:var(--mint2)">PROACTIVE PROPOSAL</span><span>REACTIVE RFP</span></div><div class="bar"><b></b></div><div class="labs"><strong>Weak Signal</strong><strong>Strong Signal</strong><strong>Valley of Death</strong><span>Go to Market</span><span>Market Breakout</span><span>Established Trend</span><span>Market Saturation</span><span>Fading Signal</span></div></div><div class="grid2"><div class="card dark" style="text-align:center"><b><u>Shaping demand</u> before it materializes.</b><br>Operating upstream — <b><i><u>engaging before the need is named.</u></i></b></div><div class="card" style="text-align:center"><b>Competing <u><i>after</i></u> demand is visible to everyone</b><br>Operating <b><i>faster and better</i></b> within the market — but still within it.</div></div><div class="footer"><span>vivicta*</span><span>03</span></div></section>

<!-- 4 ENGAGE -->
<section class="slide"><div class="eyebrow">UPSTREAM ADVANTAGE</div><h2>ENGAGE BEFORE THE CUSTOMER HAS FULLY RECOGNIZED THE NEED</h2><div class="timeline"><div class="trow"><span style="color:var(--mint2)">PROACTIVE PROPOSAL</span><span>REACTIVE RFP</span></div><div class="bar"><b></b></div><div class="labs"><strong>Weak Signal</strong><strong>Strong Signal</strong><strong>Valley of Death</strong><span>Go to Market</span><span>Market Breakout</span><span>Established Trend</span><span>Market Saturation</span><span>Fading Signal</span></div></div><div class="grid2"><div class="card dark"><div class="pill">LEFT OF THE NAMED NEED</div><div style="font-family:Sora;font-size:28px;font-weight:700">Create new demand</div><p>Foresight-driven and co-creative. Funnel customer — and internal development — leads into the sales pipeline before a specification exists.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="pill">ONCE THE NEED IS NAMED</div><div style="font-family:Sora;font-size:28px;font-weight:700">Close with excellence</div><p>Validated proposal from several days to under two business days. The same system that sensed the signal now answers it with capacity, capability, and evidence.</p></div></div><p style="font-size:18px">Turn <b>emerging market signals</b> into evidence-backed <i>customer conversations, solutions, and proposals.</i></p><div class="footer"><span>vivicta*</span><span>04</span></div></section>

<!-- 5 MODULAR -->
<section class="slide"><div class="eyebrow">SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE</div><h2>MODULAR SALES MOTION FROM ‘SENSING’ TO ‘CUSTOMER VALUE’</h2><div class="card" style="margin:12px 0;font-size:12px"> <span class="pill" style="background:var(--mint)">MODULES:</span> <span class="pill" style="background:#0A2A3A;color:var(--mint)">SCANNER</span> → <span class="pill" style="background:#0A2A3A;color:var(--mint)">DIAGNOSTIC ENGINE</span> → <span class="pill" style="background:#0A2A3A;color:var(--mint)">SIMULATOR</span> → <span class="pill" style="background:#0A2A3A;color:var(--mint)">PROPOSAL</span> → <span class="pill" style="background:#0A2A3A;color:var(--mint)">RFP ORCHESTRATOR</span> → <span class="pill" style="background:var(--mint)">IMPACT OPPORTUNITY PLATFORM</span><br><span style="color:var(--muted)">Phase 1: Opportunity Sensing · Phase 2: Structural Diagnosis · Phase 3: Solution Architecture · Phase 4: Value Finalization · FREE-CAPACITY TRIGGERED PROPOSAL CREATION · PROACTIVE PROPOSAL / RFP / ENGAGE</span></div><p><b>Systematically converting external change, weak signals, customer context, organizational capability, and available capacity into timely customer engagement.</b></p><b><u>This helps solve a common organizational disconnect:</u></b><ul><li><b>foresight sees changes</b> but does not own customers,</li><li>Sales owns customers but <b>may not see emerging structural changes,</b></li><li>Sales relies to <b>traditional buying signals maintaining reactive sales and price competition,</b></li><li>service development has capabilities but <b>may not know where demand is emerging and/or developing,</b></li><li>delivery has capacity information but <b>does not shape the opportunity pipeline,</b></li><li><b>proposal teams respond</b> when the opportunity is already formalized within tight schedules,</li><li><b>shared win/loss analysis</b> as knowledge base for proposal accuracy development does not exist,</li><li><b>weak signals</b> that would never surface through account management <b>become starting point for new relationships.</b></li></ul><div class="footer"><span>vivicta*</span><span>05</span></div></section>

<!-- 6 AGENTIC -->
<section class="slide"><div class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</div><h2>THE AGENTIC SALES MOTION: ENABLING STRATEGIC VALUE TO CUSTOMER</h2><div class="card" style="border-radius:24px;margin-top:12px"><div class="grid2"><div><div class="eyebrow">01 SENSING</div><b>Scanner scans Domain / Signal / Market</b><p class="sub">Continuous scan of 30 megatrends + organizational health across hundreds of accounts. Produces weak signals before they become briefs.</p><div class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:10px">03 ARCHITECTURE</div><b>Simulator tests capability / capacity</b><p class="sub">Co-creates what-good-looks-like roadmap with customer. Simulates delivery scenarios, team composition, ROI timeline.</p></div><div><div class="eyebrow">02 DIAGNOSIS</div><b>Diagnostic Engine links exposure / vulnerability</b><p class="sub">Maps customer assets & processes to risk. What breaks if directive X changes? Quantifies operational exposure.</p><div class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:10px">04 FINALIZATION</div><b>Proposal + RFP Orchestrator</b><p class="sub">Generates evidence pack, draft proposal outline, and when tender emerges — orchestrates >95% first-time-right response.</p></div></div></div><div class="card dark" style="margin-top:10px"><b><u>KEY DELIVERABLES FOR CUSTOMERS:</u></b><div class="grid2"><ul><li>earlier visibility into emerging risks,</li><li>more time to respond,</li><li>evidence-backed recommendations,</li></ul><ul><li>better quality of strategic options,</li><li>better alignment between investment and business outcomes.</li></ul></div></div><div class="footer"><span>vivicta*</span><span>06</span></div></section>

<!-- 7 BUYING INSIGHT -->
<section class="slide"><div class="eyebrow">CORE ARTIFACT</div><h2>‘BUYING INSIGHT & HYPOTHESIS’ - COMBINES NOW AND FORESIGHTS</h2><div class="grid2" style="margin-top:12px"><div class="card dark"><div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--mint2)">BUYING HYPOTHESIS & INSIGHT · ADMIN ARTIFACT</div><div style="font-family:Sora;font-size:42px;font-weight:800">Sisu Auto</div><p style="color:#B9CFC6;font-size:13px">Need hypothesis and demand-creation potential, not confirmed buying intent. Customer-facing use must follow each insight gate.</p><div class="card" style="background:#0F1D1A;color:#D6E8E0;font-size:13px">C — Question-Led Draft · Use internally only as discovery prompts.<br>• 36 evidence items + 4 financial refs • Guardrails + semantic gate review</div></div><div><p><a data-link="buyingInsight" href="#">‘Buying Insight & Hypothesis’</a> <b>is one of the key artifacts</b> to be utilized during the foresight-driven, agentic sales motion.</p><p><b>It combines following:</b><br>1. <a data-link="futureDemand" href="#">Foresight Knowledge,</a><br>2. Company Summary,<br>3. Market Pressure Analysis,<br>4. <a data-link="aiGovernance" href="#">Evidence-gated cognitive model,</a><br>5. Weak signals and current status of company.</p><p><b>‘Buying Insight & Hypothesis’ can be used two ways:</b><br>1. As its own, with is information,<br>2. Triggered from ‘Signal’ to ‘Proactive Proposal’ to be validated by human / team / Sales.</p></div></div><div class="footer"><span>vivicta*</span><span>07</span></div></section>

<!-- 8 EXAMPLE -->
<section class="slide"><div class="eyebrow">PROOF · REAL CASE</div><h2>ONE EXAMPLE: ENABLING ‘FREEDOM-TO-CHOOSE’</h2><p style="text-align:right;color:#0A7A54;margin:6px 0"><b>Real case:</b> AI-Driven ‘Impact Opportunity Platform’</p><div class="grid2"><div class="card"><small><b>CASE: NORDIC MID-SIZE IT CONSULTANCY COMPANY</b><br>Employees >500<br>Turnover > 100M€<br>Key service areas: Data / ITSM / AI / Security / IT Consultancy</small><div class="card dark" style="margin-top:10px;text-align:center"><b class="mint">RFP ORCHESTRATOR</b><br><small>IMPACT OPPORTUNITY PLATFORM · PULL / PUSH · TAILORED / E2E NEW SOLUTION / PREDICTABLE 24/7</small></div></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px"><div class="kpi"><b>–70%</b><span>Request-to-Offer time</span></div><div class="kpi"><b>+50%</b><span>Winning ratio</span></div><div class="kpi"><b>+35%</b><span>NPS</span></div><div class="kpi"><b>under 2d</b><span>Strategic Validation Loop</span></div><div class="kpi"><b>90%</b><span>Utilisation</span></div><div class="kpi"><b>+20%</b><span>Net profit (3% → 15%)</span></div></div></div><p style="font-size:14px;margin-top:10px">This organization changed the Demand Creation, Capacity Planning to ‘pull’, functions to Service Areas <b>and stood up the Impact Opportunity Platform including the RFP Orchestrator as one, holistic system. The numbers are the outcome of that combined working: not a claim that AI, software, or reorganisation alone, would have produced them.</b></p><div class="footer"><span>vivicta*</span><span>08</span></div></section>

<!-- 9 IDENTIFY -->
<section class="slide"><div class="eyebrow">BUSINESS IMPACT</div><h2>IDENTIFY NEW CUSTOMER OPPORTUNITIES – ENABLING EVOLVING CUSTOMER LOYALTY</h2><p class="sub"><i>Sales Motion from Foresight-Driven Demand Creation to Responsive Proposal Excellence</i></p><div class="timeline"><div class="trow"><span style="color:var(--mint2)">PROACTIVE PROPOSAL</span><span>REACTIVE RFP</span></div><div class="bar"><b></b></div><div class="labs"><strong>Weak Signal</strong><strong>Strong Signal</strong><strong>Valley of Death</strong><span>Go to Market</span><span>Market Breakout</span><span>Established Trend</span><span>Market Saturation</span><span>Fading Signal</span></div></div><div class="card"><div class="grid2"><div><b>Creating the foresight-driven new demand with co-creative approach.</b><p><b><u>POTENTIAL TOPICS FOR EFFECTS AND IMPACTS:</u></b></p><ul><li>Help <b>Customers or internal development leads/desires</b> to be funneled to <b>sales pipeline.</b></li><li><b>Signal-triggered Case Ratio</b></li><li>Decrease of <b>Sales Costs / Decreasing Customer churn rate.</b></li><li><b>Decreased Cognitive Load / Improved EX</b></li><li>Agentic Sales Motion with <b>zero human intervention from Signal to draft Proposal.</b></li><li><b>Proposal Creation Accuracy Improvement</b></li></ul></div><div><b>Validated proposal from several days to <u>≤2 business days.</u></b><ul><li>Time ‘Request-to-Offer’ <b>reduction</b></li><li><b>Winning Ratio</b> increase</li><li><b>NPS</b> improvement.</li><li>Time from Signal to Completed ‘Strategic Validation Loop’ <b>&lt;2 days</b></li><li><b>Utilization Rate</b></li><li><b>Net profit</b> increased</li><li><b>Customer Gate:</b> proposal is never sent without human validation — Service Owners + Sales owns the narrative and decisions.</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="footer"><span>vivicta*</span><span>09</span></div></section>

<!-- 10 PILOT -->
<section class="slide"><div class="eyebrow">PILOT & ADOPTION</div><h2>IMPLEMENTATION ‘MODULE-BY-MODULE’ AND ITS ADOPTION MECHANISM</h2><div class="grid3" style="margin-top:12px"><div><p><b><i>Use Modules as the adoption mechanism for the potential, fully utilized flow of Agentic Sales Motion.</i></b></p><p>Therefore, Impact Opportunity Platform should potentially be built <b>after Engines and RFP Orchestrator have produced</b> validated solutions and the flow works as designed.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="pill">● ALREADY CODED — PILOT READY</div><div class="card" style="background:#EAF6F0;margin-top:8px">✔ <b>SCANNER</b><br><small>Domain / Signal / Market scan</small></div><div class="card" style="background:#EAF6F0">✔ <b>DIAGNOSTIC ENGINE</b><br><small>Exposure & vulnerability mapping</small></div><div class="card" style="background:#EAF6F0">✔ <b>SIMULATOR</b><br><small>Roadmap co-creation, scenario</small></div><div class="card" style="background:#EAF6F0">✔ <b>RFP ORCHESTRATOR</b><br><small>Proposal generation >95% FTR</small></div></div><div><div class="card" style="background:var(--mint);border:0">AI Assessment / AI Governance / FinOps / Adaptability / Buying Insight / RFP Orchestrator / Market Intelligence + others</div><p><b>Modules are ready and those works.</b></p><p><b>Each module creates value independently horizontally and vertically: <span style="color:#0A7A54">shared learning done with real cases.</span></b></p></div></div><div class="card" style="margin-top:10px"><div class="grid3"><div><b>90-Day Pilot<br>Proposal - Clear & Measurable</b></div><div><b>SCOPE 2 domains × 10 accounts × 90 days</b><br>Focused, not enterprise-wide. Choose one regulated + one industrial.<br><br><b>INTEGRATION CRM + Service Catalog + Resource Planning</b><br>Read-only first. No workflow disruption.</div><div><b>SUCCESS CRITERIA Signal → Validation &lt;2 days</b><br><b>Signal-triggered ratio >25%</b> in pilot, path to >50% in 18mo<br><br><b>Governance:</b> Weekly review, Evidence Quality Log, Shared Learning Sessions</div></div></div><div class="footer"><span>vivicta*</span><span>10</span></div></section>

<!-- 11 REALLOCATION -->
<section class="slide"><div class="eyebrow">CALL TO ACTION</div><h2>CALL FOR REALLOCATION OF HUMAN CAPACITY</h2><p><b>Shaping demand before it materialises <u>is not</u> primarily a cost saving.</b></p><p>It is a reallocation of human capacity toward the work that creates durable advantage: <b>early-stage customer relationships, foresight-based signal interpretation, and the development of accounts and services.</b></p><div class="grid3"><div class="card"><h3>Early-stage relationships</h3><p class="sub">Be present when need is forming, not when tender drops. Trust built upstream.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Foresight-based signal interpretation</h3><p class="sub">Translate megatrend + org health into customer-specific risk & opportunity.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Development of accounts and services</h3><p class="sub">Co-create roadmaps that make our capabilities the natural next step.</p></div></div><p><b>The system’s job is to give Sales the exact reason why to contact a potential customer:</b></p><ul><li>detect weak signals from foresight-driven market intelligence,</li><li>form a buying insight and a hypothesis before a specification exists,</li><li>trigger proactive scanning when capacity or capability utilisation begins to fall,</li><li>create, refine and finalise an evidence-gated proposal for human to validate and decide — faster, and at a higher win-rate, than competitors who wait for the RFP.</li></ul><div class="card dark" style="display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap"><b class="mint" style="max-width:420px">Efficacy is the point: shape demand, and enable a customer experience that can keep evolving.</b><b><i>Are we ready to reallocate our human capacity - or only to automate the work we already do?</i></b></div><div class="footer"><span>vivicta*</span><span>11</span></div></section>

